# Visibility-only CODEOWNERS (OVD-888, parent OVD-854).
#
# These owners are auto-requested as reviewers so changes to the listed paths
# are visible to them. Branch protection on main does NOT require code-owner
# review ("Require review from Code Owners" stays off). Agent PRs are authored
# from @optomachina's own account, and an author cannot approve their own PR,
# so a required owner review would deadlock every PR that touches these paths.
#
# Revisit this if agent PRs move to a separate bot account. The repo already has
# another collaborator with write access (Hexseeker), so a second reviewer exists
# today, but only a distinct author identity makes a required review workable.

/.github/ @optomachina
/scripts/ @optomachina

# This file lands with #818. A pattern for a file that does not exist yet is
# valid and starts matching as soon as the file does.
/docs/sensitive-paths.json @optomachina
